의 IP 주소를","words":[{"text":"능을","x":193,"y":1411,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"발휘하였다.","x":262,"y":1413,"width":152,"height":31},{"text":"더","x":431,"y":1412,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"나아가서,","x":470,"y":1410,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"대부분의","x":608,"y":1410,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"로컬","x":728,"y":1409,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"DNS","x":796,"y":1410,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"서버들은","x":875,"y":1409,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"최상위","x":1001,"y":1409,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"도메인","x":1099,"y":1410,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"서버들의","x":1199,"y":1410,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"IP","x":1329,"y":1413,"width":29,"height":27},{"text":"주소를","x":1368,"y":1411,"width":88,"height":31}]},{"text":"개시하고 있어서 질의 과정에서 자주 DNS 루트 서버를 거치지 않고(즉, 우회하예 서비스할 수","words":[{"text":"개시하고","x":194,"y":1463,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"있어서","x":322,"y":1464,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"질의","x":420,"y":1463,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"과정에서","x":488,"y":1462,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"자주","x":613,"y":1462,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"DNS","x":683,"y":1463,"width":66,"height":29},{"text":"루트","x":762,"y":1463,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"서버를","x":831,"y":1461,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"거치지","x":931,"y":1461,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"않고(즉,","x":1030,"y":1461,"width":109,"height":35},{"text":"우회하예","x":1156,"y":1462,"width":127,"height":32},{"text":"서비스할","x":1298,"y":1462,"width":118,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":1426,"y":1463,"width":31,"height":30}]},{"text":"있도록 허용하고 있다.","words":[{"text":"있도록","x":194,"y":1514,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"허용하고","x":290,"y":1515,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":415,"y":1514,"width":65,"height":32}]},{"text":"DNS에 대한 참재적으로 보다 효과적인 DDoS 공격은, 예를 들어 .com 도메인을 다루는 모","words":[{"text":"DNS에","x":241,"y":1567,"width":95,"height":31},{"text":"대한","x":350,"y":1567,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"참재적으로","x":416,"y":1566,"width":141,"height":32},{"text":"보